{"id":"_summary","shard":"Furniture-02","checked":300,"ok":198,"issues":114,"by_kind":{"category":56,"facets":31,"variant":11,"brand":10,"name":5,"junk":1},"high":49,"rule_gaps":["bedroom TEXTILES (dyne/fiberdyne/laken/fasonglaken/sengesett/putevar/sengeteppe/fiberpute) resolve to Furniture - JYSK's bare 'Soverom' crumb and Kid's 'Soverom > ...' crumbs need to land in Home; 26 rows in this shard alone","rugs and mats (ryeteppe, bomullsteppe, 'Hall matte', gangmatter) resolve to Furniture and should be Home","srcCat 'Møbelpleie' (furniture-care oils, creams, cleaners) resolves to Furniture - it is a care-product vocabulary, not a furniture one; 6 rows here","facetrules.js reads 'benk' in 'TV-benk / TV benk & mediabenk' as seating and stamps type=Chairs on TV units (4 rows), and 'kontorstol' as type=Tables (2 rows)","facetrules.js derives a Furniture type from accessory rows (filtknott/møbelknott 'til stol og bord') - accessories should derive no type","Venture Home's 'Gold' product line makes facetrules derive color=Gold on 2 rows where Gold is the model name, not the colour"],"notes":"Category is the shard's real problem: 56 of 300 rows are not furniture at all - 26 bedding textiles, 4 rugs/mats, 6 furniture-care chemicals, plus a seed packet, a pond filter, a pet bed and two pickleball sets, all pulled in by a shop root crumb rather than the product; beyond that, 137 of 300 rows have no image and every single row carries the default icon 'sofa' (mirrors, duvets, wood oil included), and several Trademax/Chilli rows still carry untranslated Swedish names (Dubbelsäng, Bäddsoffa, Sängskåp, Tv-skåp)."}
